title: The Rote Fahne's Line
subtitle: The party paper's front page tells 200,000 members what the party thinks.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: rf_party
view-if: rf_editorial_timer <= 0 and party_banned = 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rf_editorial_timer = 3

= The Rote Fahne's Line

The editors want a clear line for the coming months. Every faction is waiting to see which way the paper leans.

- @united_front
- @offensive
- @unity
- @moscow

@united_front
title: The united front: an open hand to <span class="p-spd">SPD</span> workers.
subtitle: Pleases the <span class="f-right">Right</span>. Angers the <span class="f-left">Left</span> and <span class="f-ultra">Ultra-Left</span>.
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.lean(Q, {right: 5, left: -4, ultra: -3});
Q.spd_relation += 5;
Q.union_influence += 2;
!}

The paper calls on <span class="p-spd">SPD</span> workers to join Communists in factory councils, price-control committees and defence units. Some <span class="p-spd">SPD</span> locals answer. The Left calls it begging.

@offensive
title: The offensive: the crisis is revolutionary, prepare for power.
subtitle: Pleases the <span class="f-left">Left</span> and <span class="f-ultra">Ultra-Left</span>. Angers the <span class="f-right">Right</span>.
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.lean(Q, {left: 5, ultra: 2, right: -4});
Q.readiness += 3;
Q.spd_relation -= 5;
!}

The paper says what many members feel: the republic is finished and the question is who inherits it. Militants cheer. The <span class="p-spd">SPD</span> press quotes the article as proof that the Communists want civil war.

@unity
title: Unity: the party's strength is its discipline.
subtitle: Pleases the <span class="f-center">Middle Group</span>. Calms every faction a little.
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.lean(Q, {center: 4});
for (var f of window.RF.factions) { Q[f + '_dissent'] -= 3; }
!}

The paper prints a long appeal for party discipline and avoids the questions that divide the factions. Tempers cool, for now.

@moscow
title: The International: Moscow's lessons for the German party.
subtitle: Pleases <span class="f-stalin">Thälmann</span> and Moscow. Angers the <span class="f-ultra">Ultra-Left</span>.
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.obey(Q, 6);
!}

The paper reprints the latest resolutions of the <span class="p-comintern">Comintern</span> Executive with a respectful commentary. Moscow notices.
